#EXTM3U
#
# stations.m3u -- copy this to the root of the SD card (or the USB drive)
# as "stations.m3u". SD is preferred when both have one; they are not
# merged, because "next station" is a position and it should not depend
# on which drive is plugged in.
#
# One #EXTINF line for the name, then the stream URL. The -1 is the
# duration and a live stream has none.
#
# A bare URL on its own line also works: the host becomes the name,
# which is what pasting gives and is a better label than nothing.
#
# radio-browser.info emits this format directly -- its station endpoints
# serve M3U as well as JSON -- so a search result can be appended here
# without editing.
#
#EXTINF:-1,Michigan Radio
https://26433.live.streamtheworld.com/WUOMFM.mp3
#EXTINF:-1,WNZK
https://stream.zeno.fm/erunhwj5lekvv
